s ranging upwards stepwise from 0.025 mg/kg to', 0.991283208794064], [[[200.32553100585938, 449.0927429199219], [1441.015625, 450.2016296386719], [1441.015625, 483.4677429199219], [200.32553100585938, 482.35888671875]], '0.1 mg/kg on respiratory illness severity, cytokines, and clinical outcomes at day 28 and 36w', 0.9860911093732362], [[[200.32553100585938, 489.0121154785156], [1473.112060546875, 489.0121154785156], [1473.112060546875, 521.1693725585938], [200.32553100585938, 521.1693725585938]], 'PMA, which was published recently in Pediatric Research (29). Twenty-four infants with mean', 0.9844201115461496], [[[198.1119842529297, 523.3870849609375], [1500.78125, 522.2782592773438], [1500.78125, 562.1975708007812], [198.1119842529297, 563.3064575195312]], 'gestational age 25.0 weeks and 743 g birth weight requiring mechanical ventilation were enrolled', 0.9939831687758366], [[[199.21875, 565.5242309570312], [1436.588623046875, 563.3064575195312], [1436.588623046875, 595.4637451171875], [199.21875, 597.6814575195312]], 'at mean age of 6 days. Budesonide was detected in the blood of all infants with a half-life of', 0.9904043737878191], [[[198.1119842529297, 602.116943359375], [1404.4921875, 603.225830078125], [1404.4921875, 636.491943359375], [198.1119842529297, 635.383056640625]], '3.4 h. Treatment was associated with a sustained decrease (mean 65%) in tracheal aspirate', 0.9866840946540404], [[[201.4322967529297, 642.0363159179688], [1487.5, 642.0363159179688], [1487.5, 674.1935424804688], [201.4322967529297, 674.1935424804688]], 'cytokine levels at all three dosing levels in some, but not all, infants. There were time- and dose-', 0.9792358487844467], [[[201.4322967529297, 679.7379150390625], [1432.1614990234375, 679.7379150390625], [1432.1614990234375, 711.8951416015625], [201.4322967529297, 711.8951416015625]], 'dependent decreases in blood cortisol concentrations and changes in total blood metabolites.', 0.996205496399299], [[[199.21875, 715.2218017578125], [